'''The International 2026''' (also commonly called '''TI 2026''' or '''TI 15''') is the fifteenth annual edition of [[The International]] which will take place in August 2026 in Shanghai, China.

==Format==
*'''Group Stage''' ''(August 13 - 16)''
**Swiss-system of sixteen teams
***All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
***{{Bgcolortext|up|Top three teams}} advance to playoffs
***{{Bgcolortext|stay|4th to 13th place teams}} proceed to an elimination round
***{{Bgcolortext|down|Remaining teams}} are eliminated
**Elimination Round
***Five teams advance to playoffs
***Remaining teams are eliminated

*'''Main Event''' ''(August 20 - 23)''
**{{Abbr/TBA}}

